# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build context excludes. Keeps the image small and — critically —
# prevents baking `.env` (secrets) and ~1.1 GB of data into image layers.
#
# NOTE: runtime data comes from the GCS FUSE mount at /app/valuation_data
# (seeded separately), so the whole valuation_data/ tree is excluded here,
# INCLUDING valuation_data/macro/damodaran_*.csv — those live in the bucket.
#
# Do NOT add blanket *.csv / *.json / *.md rules: config/ and aletheia/
# ship runtime data files (universe.csv, specialized_valuation_inputs.json,
# fred_series.csv, *_METHODOLOGY.md, etc.) that must remain in the image.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Data & generated artifacts (mounted from GCS or regenerated) ──
valuation_data/
audits/
baselines/
scratch/
logs/

# ── Dead code quarantine ──
archive/
scripts/archive/

# ── Secrets & local env (NEVER bake into the image) ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Root-level scratch outputs (loose logs / traces / PDFs) ──
/*.txt
!requirements.txt
*.log
*.pdf
full_pipeline_trace.json
tag_miss_audit_results.json

# ── Known duplicate files ("foo 2.py" editor copies) ──
* 2.py
**/* 2.py

# ── Tests / docs / notebooks (not needed at runtime) ──
tests/
docs/
*.ipynb

# ── VCS & tool caches ──
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ── Build / deploy metadata not needed inside the image ──
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
cloudbuild.yaml
deploy/terraform/

# ── Editor / OS cruft ──
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
